      "text": "CEQAnet: 22 buildings of six units each; units from 1,275 sq ft (2 bed, 2.5 bath) to 2,268 sq ft (4 bed, 3.5 bath); about 0.98 acre of off-site improvements; 298 parking spaces (264 garage, 32 on-street, 2 ADA) and 24 long-term bicycle spaces; up to 71 trees removed. Site zoned R-1-40,000; local action Site Plan; APNs 397-02-110 and 397-02-111.",
